ncement Content</label> <textarea class="form-control" id="annContent" rows="4" placeholder="Enter system announcement context..." required></textarea> </div> <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" style="width: 100%;"> Publish Announcement </button> </form> </div> </div>
